The Sun Is Lazy (And That's Why You Exist) — flat-vector explainer (1080×1920, 24 fps)
Everything on screen is drawn in code (main.js, canvas 2D): the Sun, Earth, the person, the photon, the protons, the type.
No images, no stock footage, no generated media. Our own character designs, in the same style as the Moon film.
Facts: FACTS.md (Wikipedia: Sun, Solar core, Proton–proton chain; ITER; NASA; university lecture notes).

